OL,3,GNEWSACouncil's SEND improvement plan   
OL,4,Aapproved                               
OL,6,FVictoria Aitken, cabinet member for    
OL,7,Fchildren, families and education, said 
OL,8,Fthe plan was an important step forward,
OL,9,Fbut reform had to be supported by      
OL,10,F"adequate" funding.                    
